e multimodal understanding and generation systems like Nano Banana Pro and GPT-Image-2 achieve remarkable performance not because of a single model, but through a highly unified suite of system capabilities. However, under training compute that is extremely…"],"features":["📸 Beautiful and Precise Photography — Accurately understands photography prompts and generates high-quality images with natural lighting, coherent composition, and faithful details, preserving coherent subject,…","📝 Diverse and Stable Text Rendering — Supports a wide range of text-heavy designs — posters, stamps, documents, interfaces, brand guides, and handwritten boards — with readable structure, stable typography, and robust…","🎨 Diverse and Beautiful Stylization — Handles stylized generation across miniature 3D scenes, Chinese-inspired gilded aesthetics, shining fantasy visuals, anime portraits, and mythic character art — not just style…","🖌️ Versatile Image Editing — Handles a wide spectrum of editing tasks, including object insertion, replacement and removal, attribute and material modification, background and scene replacement, and faithful style…","🪧 Personalized Poster Design & Product Rendering — Generates personalized poster layouts and clean product visualizations with consistent branding, refined typography, and product-grade lighting and composition"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/boogu-project/Boogu-Image/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0ebbd07ec4528a2eccf70f0007a48c8e6efe3739b25f3f958ad57affbdd1957c","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:02:42.279Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T22:14:48.101Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Welcome to the official repository for Boogu-Image-0.1 !","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/boogu-project/Boogu-Image/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"> ## ⚠️ Important Notice > > The Boogu team does NOT currently provide any paid API, subscription, or commercial service fo